      "items": [
        "The first modern cotton textile mill was established at Fort Gloster near Kolkata in 1818, while the first successful commercial mill started in Mumbai in 1854.",
        "Chota Nagpur region is known as the 'Ruhr of India' due to its immense concentration of iron and steel industries and mineral wealth.",
